                "plan": "Padded lanes load 0 via mask; actual width n; mask offsets<n on load/store. Cast to fp32, add, cast to output dtype. Allocate fresh contiguous empty_like. Use BLOCK_SIZE=1024 for all sizes to minimize grid. Verify 4099: 4 blocks, last block masked at 4096-4098.",
