                },
                "parent_sha256": "08b5a80252feaaf4e87b7844b8ea2c48fea680f7f2a19c2ac08b932d3547dad5",
                "reply": "{\"draft\":\"Fuse LayerNorm into one pass. For small widths, load the whole row into registers, compute mean/rstd, then apply affine and store. For large widths, keep the two-loop streaming version. This removes the second read of X and the per-iteration weight/bias loads for small N, targeting the worst-case small-row shape.\",\"plan\":\"1) Host: pick BLOCK = next_pow2(width). 2) If BLOCK <= 1024, use a single-load kernel that keeps the row in registers. 3) Else use the existing two-loop kernel. 4) Always allocate a fresh contiguous output and launch one program per row.\",\"code_lines\":[\"import torch\",\"import triton\",\"import triton.language as tl\",\"\",\"\",\"@triton.jit\",\"def _ln_small(\",\"    X,\",\"    Y,\",\"    W,\",\"    B,\",\"    stride,\",\"    N,\",\"    eps,\",\"    BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    EVEN: tl.constexpr,\",\"    IS_BF16: tl.constexpr,\",\"    OUT_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    IN_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    W_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    B_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    X_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    Y_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    W_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    B_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    X_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    Y_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    W_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    B_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    X_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    Y_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    W_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    B_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    X_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    Y_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    W_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    B_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    X_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    Y_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    W_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    B_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    X_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    Y_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    W_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    B_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    X_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    Y_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    W_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    B_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    X_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    Y_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\",\"    W_DTYPE: tl.constexpr,\"