                "draft": "Hypothesis: passing DTYPE as a runtime arg fails; pointer encodes dtype. Contradiction: compile error at .to(DTYPE). Fix: remove DTYPE param; let tl.store cast. Verify: row0 col0 offset 0; row1 col0 offset width. Padded cols masked to 0.",
